{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1509032674"}, "name":{"label":"#ItsSienna"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-28T00:09:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.6"}, "id":{"label":"13895278537"}, "title":{"label":"I love it!! (PLS RESD ASAP!!!)"}, "content":{"label":"As I said I love it, first i was confused a lot!!! But then i started to understand all and everything, everything was so neatly laid out, nicely put out… but if there 1… sorry 2 problems to fix the following woukd be it (to me, as a opinion)\n\n\n(IMPORTANT TO FIX) 1. The Feature of ‘Repeat’ (is on premium) - I get it, things need to be on premium so people buy it, MARKETING!!!… but that one frature is really important, because most of the days, you have to eat breakfast, or you have to work/study… but having that always duplicated is pretty hard if you ask me. That’d be a GREAT… no SUPERB problem to fix\n\n(Not Needed To Fix Straight Away) 2. The Widget Sizing On Homescreen (Not that important) - I dont find this NEARLY as important as the first, but i feel like this is needed a lilttle fix on this to. If you could change the size of the widgets we add on the screen. Because having the largest widget is really important to me. And the biggest (on iOS, i have seen). The size i want is \nWidth: 21–23 cm \nHeight: 10–11 cm\nThe size to you have (thats needs to be changed to 👆)\nWidth: 10–11 cm\nHeight: 10–11 cm\n\nSo pretty much the biggest size widgets have on an iOS needs to be added please? \n\n(Plus(Optional!!!) : Make Sub-Tasks more visible, especially on a widget so we can tick them off of the widget)\n\n\n\nP.S : YOU ARE GREAT AT MAKING DESIGN AND APPS!!!! HOPE YOU REPLY REAL SOOOONNN!!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
